window.products.push({"id":563010,"name":"DeLonghi WR45 Retro 4-Slice Belgian Waffle Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RZZ6T6EPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Delonghi Large Rectangle Waffle Maker with audible signal and adjustable thermostat Amazon.com Looking like a chrome handbag from the 1940s, the DeLonghi Retro Belgian Waffle Maker is gorgeous and sleek. But the beauty is more than skin deep, because it is also a hard-working appliance. High-polished chrome with softer, brushed accents, the waffle maker will make a statement in any stylish kitchen. And in addition to the waffles for which it was ultimately designed, it can also be used for grilled sandwiches and other toasted and griddled delights. Two features highlight this versatility. First, an adjustable hinge offers two different height levels, so the lid can close tightly for waffles or remain more widely open for thick panini. Secondly, the WR45 comes with a set of reversible plates; each has a nonstick flat griddle side, as well as the traditional deep-pocket waffle forms. To select the desired degree of browning, there's an adjustable thermostat dial. A green ready light illuminates when the griddle has reached the desired temperature, followed by 6 beeps announcing that the griddle plate's ready to receive the waffle batter. The green light will go off when the latch is closed and baking begins; when the four 3-1/2-by-5-inch waffles are ready, it will light back up, accompanied by three beeps. When cleaned and ready to put away, the snug safety latch allows for space-saving vertical storage. To clean the metal casing, use only a warm, damp cloth; dry with a soft towel. Clean plates with a damp cloth and a nonabrasive cleanser--never use any sharp or pointed implements to scrape plates. Always unplug device before cleaning it. DeLonghi waffle makers are not immersible. The WR25 measures 12 by 13 by 5 inches, including handle and feet. DeLonghi guarantees its waffle irons with a limited one-year warranty. A list of DeLonghi service locations is included. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RZZ6T6EPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B0000CDCMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CDCMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CDCMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563011,"name":"8PCS Replenishment Parts Kit Compatible with Roomba 980 960 900 800 801 805 860 870 880 890 Vacuum Cleaner - Roomba Accessories with 3pcs Hepa Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OwmanElYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"800 and 900 Series Replenishment Kit Compatible with Roomba 880 860 870 960 980,8PCS Roomba Accessories with 3pcs Hepa filters,3pcs Side Brushes, 1 Pair Debris Extractors How to install your new Extractors: STEP 1. Pinch And Pull Up The Extractor Frame STEP 2.Pull Extractor Frame Open STEP 3.Remove Extractors And Replace Extractors Bymatching The Extractor Color With The Arrow Color On The Cleaning Head Module STEP 4.Close The Extractor Frame And Push Firmly Until You Feel It Latch Into Place STEP 5.For Additional Mainterance Instruction Or Support ,Please Feel Free To Contact Us How to Install the Side Brushes: Remove The Brush, Remove The Hair Or Debris, And Put The Side Brushes Back In Place. How to clean and Install the Filters: STEP 1. Remove The Bin By Pressing The Bin Release Button STEP 2.Open The Bin Door To Empty The Bin And Press And Lift The Filtered Or Release Tab STEP 3.Remove The Filter By Grasping The Yellow Tab,Then Clean Room Was Filter By Tapping Against Your Trash Container STEP 4.To Reinstall The Filter, Press The Metal Filter Lever, With The Side Of Filter And Push The Filter Down NOTES: 1-The Filter Door Will Not Close If The Filter Is Not Installed Correctly. 2-The replacement 800 900 Accessories for Roomba are not Roomba OEM product and is not covered under any Roomba manufacturer's warranty.The Roomba brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. 3-If \"error 2\" appears, try to remove the side brush before using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OwmanElYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cleando","source_asin":"B07DPKHWMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DPKHWMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DPKHWMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
