window.products.push({"id":563188,"name":"Vacplus Moisture Absorber, 10 Pack Portable Dehumidifiers for Closet and Enclosed Space, 14 OZ Dehumidifier Bags Effectively Trap Extra Moisture, Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yVHEY2YaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFECTIVE ABSORPTION - Vacplus moisture absorber bags effectively absorb extra moisture from the air and trap the moisture in bags. This product features a large capacity of 14 oz with globular calcium chloride particles inside, which could efficiently enlarge the dehumidifying area and eliminate unpleasant smell as an air fresher, keeping the place comfy for a longer time. VISIBLE DEHUMIDIFICATION - The lower transparent moisture bag could separate the collected moisture from calcium chloride particles, and efficiently improve the effectiveness of the dehumidification. The collected moisture would directly drop into the collecting bag. The dehumidifying status of moisture remover bags can be clearly observed any time. HANGING DESIGN - Compared with many traditional dehumidifiers, Vacplus moisture absorber bags with the hanging design provide a simpler dehumidification method to protect clothes or valuable stuff from humidity. You could hang this humidity aborber bag anywhere for dehumidifying. Vacplus safe moisture absorber based on physical dehumidification adds no burdens to the environment. MULTIPLE PURPOSES - Vacplus moisture absorber bags with the hanging design is an ideal dehumidifier for home and enclosed space such as closets, bathrooms, kitchens, laundry rooms, RV, boats, and basements. All you need to do is removing the package and hang it in the desired spots. The moisture absorber bags would bring a dry and comfortable vibe to the place. HOW IT WORKS - When the white calcium chloride particles in moisture absorber packets sufficiently absorb moisture from the air, they will gradually melt and come together as one chunk. As the dehumidification goes on, they will finally dissolve. The dehumidification process may take time. Please be patient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yVHEY2YaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacplus","source_asin":"B0C69GZ78Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C69GZ78Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C69GZ78Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
