window.products.push({"id":563220,"name":"Wellsome, Plant Vegetable Grow Bags Premium Planting Pots with Handles for Potatoes, Tomatoes, Herbs, Flowers, and More in Gardens, Patios, Balconies ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sHWileyAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wellsome Grow Bag Benefits: 1. Healthier Root System: Encourage root pruning rather than root circling. 2. Temperature Control: Shed excess heat through breathable fabric. 3. Prevents Over-Watering: Excess water will percolate through the fabric material. 4. Easy Storage: Can be folded up and stored with minimal space. 5. Versatile: Can easily be moved or planted in the ground. Size Selections: 1-Gallon: 7.1 inch width 5.9 inch height 3-Gallon: 9.8 inch width 8.7 inch height 7-Gallon: 11.8 inch width 13.8 inch height 10-Gallon: 11.8 inch width 15.7 inch height Instructions: Step 1: Choose your bags Our 1-gallon and 3-gallon grow bags are your perfect fits for small plants and/or balcony gardening. Our windowed 7-gallon and 10-gallon grow bags make planting, growing, and harvesting your vegetables easier. Step 2: Planting Spread a few inches of soil/nutrients in the bottom of the grow bag. Place the seeds/plants in the soil and cover up with few more inches of soil/nutrients. Water and observe the plants. Step 3: Growing Continue to water and observe the plants. As the plants sprout and emerge, continue to add soil/nutrients until the plants emerge to the top of the bag. Step 4: Harvesting Harvest away! If you chose our windowed grow bags, simply harvest through the window!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sHWileyAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wellsome","source_asin":"B092V82DML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092V82DML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092V82DML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
