window.products.push({"id":563393,"name":"Fenton Complete Bed with Metal Duo Panels and Globe Finials, Black Walnut Finish, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71INlWq5TtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The clean lines of the Fenton are reminiscent of great architectural styles of the past and provide a neutral backdrop for any designer's imagination. Constructed of carbon steel for stability and years of everyday use, the gentle curve and alternating length slats of the 49.75-inch headboard and 34.25-inch footboard playfully suggests a lightness that makes this bedroom piece a perfect fit in any size room. The multi-step, hand-applied Black Walnut finish embodies a brushed “antiquing” look. The engineered bed frame consists of iron rails, cross arms and glides to provide full support to your mattress and box spring. A good ornamental bed, like the Fenton, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. The clean and calming simplistic style will provide that stunning centerpiece needed in your master suite or guestroom. This unit includes a duo headboard and footboard panel, leg extensions, bed frame, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Fenton Complete Bed comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71INlWq5TtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B00091QVJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00091QVJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00091QVJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
