window.products.push({"id":563412,"name":"American Atelier Round Wooden Tray - Natural Finish Metal Twig Designed Handles Coffee Tea Dinner Party - Great Centerpiece & Gift Idea, 14.9\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HjmMFAnVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A perfect accessory in any home, the American Atelier Round Wooden Tray With Twig Handles will come in handy when you have a dinner party or holiday celebration . Whether you place it on a table or walk around to serve your guests individually, this tray will make a bold statement with an added dose of rustic charm . Expertly crafted of solid wood with an easy-to-incorporate, brown finish , this tray will seamlessly blend in with any interior design . Metal handles add to the long-term durability and use, furnished to resemble twigs for increased visual appeal. Serve all your favorite hors d’oeuvres; cheeses, vegetables, fruits or meat on an attractive wood tray beautifully accented with twig-designed handles . These sturdy, attractive handles provide an easy way to serve guests , or allow them to pass it around and serve themselves. In addition to serving, the American Atelier Tray makes a great centerpiece on the dining room table, countertop of buffet table. Simply place the impressive tray down with all your tasty treats or mixed drinks and elevate your dinner party or family get-together . A great gift for any special occasion, this Wooden Tray With Twig Handles is perfect for bridal showers, weddings, housewarming parties or as a thank you to the host/hostess at a special gathering. If they like to entertain and love that rustic look , they’re sure to cherish this gift and use it to serve their guests at every party they throw!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HjmMFAnVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Atelier","source_asin":"B07GBHQGS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GBHQGS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GBHQGS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563413,"name":"IDEALUX 56oz Airtight Glass Cold Brew Iced Coffee Maker and Tea Maker Glass Carafe with Removable Stainless Steel Filter, Perfect For Homemade Cold Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y7nSH3z-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superior Corrosion Proof Borosilicate Glass Cold Brew Coffee Maker】The iced coffee brewer made by High Borosilicate Glass,which a kind of clearer,more rigidity and lighter glass than conventional glass.High Borosilicate Glass is BPA free,Phthalate free & lead free,refrigerator safe & stovetop safe,withstand temperature -20°C ~150°C/-4°F~302°F.Brewing with cold water preserves all the natural goodness and sweet flavors. 【Large Capacity with SUS304 Stainless Steel Lid & Anti-drip Spout】56oz, 8cups cold coffee brewer,large enough to serve your family for daily drink. Fits well in most fridges.Anti-drip spout,Convenient to pour and easy to clean.SUS304 stainless steel lid,baby safe & medical safe rubber part arround the lid makes the lid close tightly,keeping the coffee inside fresh and the lid not falling off when pouring.Locks in different freshness and flavor for up to 2 weeks.Airtight seal,easy-access handle. 【Handcrafted & Ergonomically Design】The iced coffee maker is hand blown borosilicate glass with graceful modern lines by professional craftsman.Ergonomically designed handle is comfortable to hold.Experience refined craftsmanship you can always count on.Cold brewing extracts the natural and delicious flavors from coffee or tea, avoiding bitter tasting oils released by heat. 【Stainless Steel Mesh filter】The cold-brew coffee maker is also fit with a filter containing a removable bottom cap for fast and easy disposal of coffee grounds.The stainless steel canister can fit a large amount of coffee grounds, loose leaf or small tea bags, making it faster to brew in 12-18 hours. Keeping your home brews fresh for up to 2 weeks. The ability to get cold-brewed coffee overnight will save you time and money. 【Easy to Clean & Stove Safe,Microwave Safe & Dishwasher Safe.】The cold-brew coffee maker is also fit with a filter containing a removable bottom cap for fast and easy disposal of coffee grounds.The brewer can be disassembled and cleaned in less than a minute. Also dishwasher safe if you prefer a hands-free","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y7nSH3z-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IDEALUX","source_asin":"B0827MCDFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0827MCDFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0827MCDFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
