window.products.push({"id":563489,"name":"Cookie Stamp - Wooden Handle and 4 Silicone Interchangeable Cookie Stamper. Squirrel, Owl, Hedgehog, and chickey stamp. Each With Their Own Special Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RJKw2295L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*The best way to make these cookies is to roll out the dough (sugar cookies work great -oh, and shortbread cookies - I have also used it with snickerdoodles) and stamp your cute picture and message onto the dough then use a cookie cutter of larger size than the stamp to encircle the design. I just use a round drinking glass. Be sure and chill the dough first - that seems to help when working with the stamps. Also, if your dough is sticking (it shouldn't, but just in case) an ever so slight \"dusting\" of cooking spray should do the trick. *While this product is silicone and you could probably cook with it, I wouldn't. I only use it for stamping so it will last longer. *Be creative and make a square cookie with a cute stamp in the middle - the fun is only limited to your creativity. *Don't forget, these are great for gifts. When you order it from Amazon it comes in a box and makes the receiver open it like a present - you know, Birthday's- Christmas... *If you didn't notice, we also sell this as a combination cookie stamper and silicone candy molds. We sell them as a combined set if you or someone you love is into creative cooking. Take a look. *Ready for fun? Then place your order and thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RJKw2295L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Designs by Nikole","source_asin":"B00Y78EBRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y78EBRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y78EBRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
