window.products.push({"id":563510,"name":"imarku Frying Pan, Stainless Steel Skillet, Professional Grade Pan for Cooking, Tri-Ply Steel Skillet Cookware for Home Kitchen Restaurant, Unique Ham","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R+W2l27dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Healthy Food-grade Material】: This frying pan is made of 304 food-grade stainless steel and high-purity aluminum bonded together, This frying pan has no coating, not easy to rust, It has great advantages over nonstick pans, has good corrosion resistance, heat resistance, low-temperature strength, and mechanical properties. can avoid the hazards caused by coating peeling and rust. 【12 inches Large Frying Pan】: This large 12-inch frying pan can cook a lot of food at the same time, meeting the needs of different families for cooking, providing plenty of space for cooking. the bottom is flat and wide, the stainless steel skillet is equipped with an ergonomic handle to provide a comfortable grip during cooking. and the inside is smooth and shiny There is a convenient hole in the handle of the cooking pan, so you can easily hang the cooking pan on the shelf. 【Multifunctional Cookware】: The outer layer of this stainless steel skillet is 430 stainless steel, stainless steel pan has tri-ply construction and can distribute the heat evenly, and is durable. The cooking pan has good corrosion resistance. The pan body is made of high-grade heat-conducting materials, compatible with electricity, gas, and microcrystalline cookware. It can also be used in the oven. it can easily cope with it. Let you enjoy the original taste of the food. 【Unique Hammered Design】:The hammer pattern design of stainless steel cookware adopts royal craftsmanship. Under the light, the hammer pattern can show a sparkling color. The unique hammer pattern of the stainless steel cookware adds warmth and elegance to the kitchen. Allows you to enjoy the beautiful scenery while enjoying the food. 【Cleaning and Maintenance】: This stainless steel frying pan is easy to clean and not easy to rust. It is better than nonstick pans, You only need to add water or detergent, wipe the inside and outside with a sponge. After first using the pan, be sure to clean it up quickly. Don't put it aside, then wipe it with a dry cloth and place it in a dry place. so as not to rust due to residual food grease. If you have any questions, We will reply within 24 hours after receiving your email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R+W2l27dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"imarku","source_asin":"B093WHCGKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093WHCGKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093WHCGKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
