window.products.push({"id":563588,"name":"Haute Decor Adapt Adjustable Wreath Hanger (Oil-Rubbed Bronze) — Over The Door Wreath Hanger — Year-Round Indoor or Outdoor Wreath Hook — Holds up to ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JyO3-2qvL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"BUY THE ORIGINAL- Haute Decor is the original designer and manufacturer of the Adapt Adjustable Wreath Hanger and has been selling it for over 15 years. Adapt is a trademark of Haute Decor. PERFECT FOR ANY SIZED DOOR: The slide mechanism on our door hanger hook can easily extend from 16.5\" to 25\", making it great for any sized door. The hook can firmly grip onto doors up to 1.8\" thick. Our wreath door hanger is a simple and long-lasting way to add beautiful decorations to your home or office. SIMPLE INSTALLATION: Some wreath hangers require tools and fasteners to attach them to your door, which can cause lasting damage. Our door hangers do not need tools or adhesives for installation! Simply slide the hanger over the top of your door. The wreath holder has protective pads that will prevent unsightly scratches and dings. Note: The the hanger will need 0.11\" of clearance to be placed properly on your door (about the thickness of two dimes). USE IT ALL YEAR: Our easy to install wreath holders are excellent for home or apartment decor. Use them all year to hang seasonal wreaths for spring, summer, fall or winter. They are great for holiday door decorations as well! HAUTE DECOR: Our company prides itself on selling beautiful decorative products for your home, apartment or office. We believe in providing top-notch customer service. If there is ever an issue with your purchase, please reach out to us and we will do our best to make it right. HAUTE DECOR WREATH HANGER: If you're searching for an easy way to hang wreaths or decorations from your door, then Haute Decor has just what you need! Our all-season adjustable hook is the perfect indoor or outdoor door hanger for wreaths.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JyO3-2qvL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haute Decor","source_asin":"B095FG998J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095FG998J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095FG998J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
