window.products.push({"id":563663,"name":"Manual Coffee Grinder,ALILIYA Quiet Hand Crank Coffee Grinding Mill,Portable Ddetachable Triangle Stainless Steel + Ceramic Grinder Mill Machine for D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-mPLWf0vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"☕【Adjustable Grind Selector】By simply turning the grind selector counterclockwise or clockwise, our manual coffee mill will provide precise grinding control from coarse to fine powder for any type of brewing methods, like French press, cold brew, drip grind, pour over etc. The partial visual base makes you better observe and control the capacity of coffee powder. ☕【Easy to Use】Manual grinding, without battery. The triangular bottle body is more stable, easy to grasp and grind. Comfortable Mechanies Allow Hand Crank designed,no time wasting on complicated installation,just put Hand Crank on it ,and by simply turning the grind selector counterclockwise or clockwise ☕【Quiet Working】The coffee burr grinder can effectively avoid the noise generated by the electric grinder from over 90% and create a quiet atmospheres. You will never worry about disturbing your loved ones' dreams in the morning. ☕【Preserve Coffee Aroma】Professional ceramic burr design makes the grinding process more detailed and the coffee powder more uniform. At the same time, it avoids overheating the coffee beans while grinding, maintains rich and original aroma for better coffee flavor. Ideal choice for coffee lovers. ☕【Stainless Steel + Ceramic Grinder】Our coffee grinders are made of food grade 304 stainless steel, more durable than plastic or glass base. Wear-resisting ceramic burrs promise longer lifespan. All parts are detachable for further deep cleaning of dead corner residues. Please allow it to dry thoroughly before reassembling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-mPLWf0vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meideli","source_asin":"B08FMC183F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FMC183F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FMC183F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
