window.products.push({"id":563675,"name":"Kombucha Brewing Charred Oak Barrel (10 Liter) Approx 2.5 gallons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rs634qbBL._AC_SL1266_.jpg","description":"When we make a kombucha barrel they use the finest American White Oak. Ever wonder why Oak is their wood of choice for a kombucha barrel? There are several reasons why. One is that Oak gives the ferment in your kombucha barrel a nutty, sort of buttery flavor, as well as additional vanillins and tannins. Over time the tannins are used up or exhausted. Every year in the life of a kombucha barrel there is a certain amount of beneficial probiotic bacteria and different yeasts that impregnate the wood. As each kombucha barrel ages each one takes on a unique blend of flavor and health all its own. When utilized properly just one kombucha barrel can last more than your entire lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rs634qbBL._AC_SL1266_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Head Barrels","source_asin":"B01MAXU0Z9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MAXU0Z9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MAXU0Z9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563676,"name":"Jim Shore Heartwood Creek Folklore Snowman Holding Heart Stone Resin Hanging Ornament, 4.375”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e7zyXvvqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jim Shore’s hand-carved Heartwood Creek collectibles impart a sense of hope and nostalgia, embracing inspiring themes of family, tradition, spirituality, and patriotism. These themes are especially evident in the Folklore collection, where rustic textures meld with lighthearted imagery and Jim Shore’s folk art styling. His unique tulip design offers a promise of spring in this heartwarming snowman ornament, sculpted from stone resin and hand-painted in loving detail. About Us: Enesco is committed to bringing joy every day. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, plush, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: GUND, Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Walt Disney Archives Collection, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Pusheen, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e7zyXvvqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jim Shore Folklore","source_asin":"B01N237KZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N237KZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N237KZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563677,"name":"Bestmart INC Counter Height Adjustable Metal Bar Stools","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7167BvSY4ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: This new arrival 2 Pcs Counter Adjustable Height Bar Stools are made of solid wood, finished with Fraxinus mandschurica Rupr ( a kind of wood, which will not craze, the best wood material for furniture). Dark bronze tone powered coat metal made legs let seat safe enough. Resin treatment make the edge looks polished. Take casual dining, bar drinking or games on this stool with swiveling style. Features: -Include 2 Stools.  -Height Adjustable with swiveling style.  -Made of solid wood & metal, covered with Fraxinus mandschurica Rupr.  -1 Year warrantee.  -Need to assemble easily. Specification: Stools Size: 14.2\" (L/W) x 1.55\" (Thickness)  Stools Adjustable Height: 20\" - 24.5\" Weight For Each: 27.78 lbs Package Include: 2 Stools Total 1 package. Note: Simple Assembly Required, please DO NOT tighten ALL BOLTS until the chair or the table is assembled completely","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7167BvSY4ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestmart INC","source_asin":"B0783B7PB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0783B7PB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0783B7PB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
