window.products.push({"id":563682,"name":"Adeco Decorative Black Wood 8 Openings Decorative Wood ''I Love You'' Collage Wall Hanging Picture Photo Frame, 4x6 in, 4.5x5 in, 3.5x5 in and 4x4 in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmxqgVmNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If a picture is worth a thousand words, then the meaning of this frame is abundantly clear! This wall hanging combines the words \"I (Heart) You\" in attractive, white block print with space for eight black-framed images. In addition to four 4x6\" and one 4.5x5\" rectangles, fill circle, heart, and square frames as well. This is a lovely birthday or anniversary gift for anyone you love, and a great statement piece in any room. Showcase your favourite moments and your favourite people with the photo frame that says it all!o frame that says it all!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmxqgVmNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adeco","source_asin":"B00EZD3LOK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EZD3LOK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EZD3LOK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563683,"name":"SPIRITUAL WARFARE by Ron DiCianni Unsigned Paper Lithograph","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XTE3iwNlL._AC_.jpg","description":"\"Spiritual Warfare\" by Ron DiCianni Unsigned Paper Lithograph Image size is 17\" x 13\" Mint Condition This is the painting that launched a revolution that brought Christianity back in contact with the Arts. Still a bestseller after almost two decades, Ron DiCianni's Spiritual Warfare depicts the everyday war between the physical and spiritual realms and shows that prayer is our most powerful weapon in that battle. It's packed with reminders to earthly fathers to bathe their families in prayer, for that is their most effective weapon in spiritual battle. Most people think that the centerpiece of the painting is the angels fighting in the window. It’s not. The focus of the painting is the shadow of the cross that’s falling on the father and son. Without that, as the assurance of our protection, I would be too afraid to approach the subject! I used some symbolism in parts of the painting that sometimes get overlooked at first glance. Look at the fathers watch – it is almost striking midnight. It was my way of saying that the “hour” (of time) is late, but also that if a dad is still up at that time praying for his child after a long day of work, I believe that God will honor that perseverance. Look also at the drapes blowing gently from open windows. I wanted to make the point that mere glass or wood could not prevent evil forces from getting to us but that prayer will! Another point of false hope is the wallpaper border of “Noah’s Ark” that adorns the room. Certainly I am in favor of wall hangings and positive messages, but not as an end in themselves. Accessorizing our rooms will do very little if we don’t pray. Our enemy knows that and would be content with all the “stuff” in the world hanging there. What Satan doesn’t want is the prayer of a righteous man over his family. Ron DiCianni","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XTE3iwNlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ron DiCianni","source_asin":"B001K28ZVI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001K28ZVI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001K28ZVI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
