window.products.push({"id":563786,"name":"Uniturcky Bamboo Silverware Ser, 24-Piece Natural Bamboo Flatware Cutlery Set for 6, Stainless Steel Silver Head with Bamboo Handle, Include knife For","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j7mJH-fqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bamboo is a wonderfully renewable natural resource. Being both lightweight and durable, it's a fantastic material for flatware and kitchen utensils. Uniturcky bamboo handle silverware set, Handcrafted. Stainless steel head splicing bamboo handle. stylish and unique. It is the perfect choice for family dinner, entertaining guests or hosting parties, also an ideal gift for relatives and friends, etc. Package Include: 6 dinner spoons, 6 dinner forks, 6 dinner knives, 6 dessert /tea spoons.  Natural Bamboo handle design:  --The bamboo handles of this flatware are hand crafted by skilled artisans. This makes each piece unique, beautiful. --We couple the gorgeous look of this sturdy and sustainable wood with the elegant look of stainless steel. Silver mirror polished stainless steel splicing natural bamboo handle utensil set will definitely give an exotic flair to your everyday meals. --Each bamboo handle piece is carefully selected and refined to achieve an ergonomic size and weight for a comfortable use. Rounded and thickened handle can heat insulation, anti-scalding. Perfect for a Picnic： These lightweight eating utensils are perfect for eating out of the home too. Bring them to your next picnic or barbecue or pack them in school lunches or for eating at the office. Weight Dimension: Dinner Knife: 8.74inch, 1.41oz Dinner Fork: 8.27inch, 1.06oz Dinner Spoon: 8.03inch, 1.06oz Dessert Spoon: 6.65inch, 0.88oz Cleaning& Maintenance Attention 1.Prior to first use of the bamboo silverware set, wash the stainless steel portion with hot water and mild soap to completely remove any contaminants. 2.To preserve the quality of bamboo handle, clean the cutlery through hand washing only. 3.After each use, be sure to wash off any food as soon as possible.  Notes: Since the handle is a natural bamboo material, each handle is not exactly the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j7mJH-fqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uniturcky","source_asin":"B09W5JT4S8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W5JT4S8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W5JT4S8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563787,"name":"The Pampered Chef Garlic Press #2575","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ny6QhmN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Pampered Chef Garlic Press #2575. The Garlic Press lets you enjoy the flavor of fresh garlic without the hard work of mincing and without your hands smelling like garlic. You can press fresh cloves of garlic—even the really big ones—without peeling them first. The handy cleaning brush helps you remove all the minced bits, so you never have to touch them. You can also use it to mince ginger and horseradish, so you get fantastic flavor in every bite of your favorite recipes. Aluminum with nonstick, silicone-based coating. Extra-large hopper accommodates large garlic cloves, ginger, and horseradish. Ergonomic handle for comfort. Cleaning tool stores with the handle so it won’t get lost. Dishwasher-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ny6QhmN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pampered Chef","source_asin":"B000N2V6DA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000N2V6DA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000N2V6DA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
