window.products.push({"id":563850,"name":"Over The Cabinet Door Organizer 4 Pack, Over Door Storage Basket with Name Plate Hooks for Cutting Board Foils Cookie Sheet, Grid Storage Bin Basket H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GXvQ5Sh0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 in 1 or Use Alone: This over the cabinet door organizer is the layered design, and you can screw all the four baskets together and hang them as a unit on the wall or on the cabinet and door to store cutting board, bakeware pan, cookie sheet or plastic food wrap. Also, you can hang 2 baskets on the wall, and 2 on the cabinet. Each basket with different size hangers. You can DIY the using methods. Wide Open Design&Name Plate: Made with a sturdy wire metal frame, this wall-mounted basket features a rectangular shape with a low front and high back to keep your items neatly tucked away and easily accessible. Each basket with one built-in name template, you can sort out and identify the items of the different organizers in a jiffy. Wall Mount&Cabinet Door Organizer&EVA Padded: Hooks fit in standard cabinet door up to 1 inch thick, or bar up to 1 inch width. Please measure your door or bar size before placing an order. Please Every piece of metal grid basket can be wall mounted. Easy to hang on the cabinet and door with included hooks. Come with EVA foam padded to protect your cabinet and door from scratch. Foldable Design& Hooks: Foldable design, when not use it, just fold down for sleek storage on a shelf or desk. Come with hanging hooks, you can use hooks to hang basket on the door. Quick Installation: There are three size of the hooks, thus there are three different height while hooks connecting with four baskets: 40.9inch,38.7inch and 41.3inch. Please make sure your cabinet fiting for the product. Just connect the basket with buckle. If you want to hang the basket on the door or cabinet, just screw the hanger on the basket. If want to mount it on the wall, use the screws included to fix it. Quick and easy installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GXvQ5Sh0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jautokerdar","source_asin":"B0B7WYL6BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7WYL6BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7WYL6BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563851,"name":"Cole and Mason 505 5-1/2 Inch Salt Mill, Clear Acrylic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-i-F3hRSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cole and Mason, the leading Brand of salt and pepper mills worldwide, is synonymous with innovative design, product performance, and quality. Our extensive range of mills, from traditional to contemporary, has something to suit every table setting. Cole and Mason's standard mills are fitted with patented mechanisms, stainless steel for pepper and nylon for salt. Our Gourmet mills feature machine cut hardened carbon steel for pepper and ceramic for salt, while the Electronic and Inverta style mills all feature ceramic mechanisms for salt and pepper. The mechanisms are fully adjustable so they deliver freshly ground pepper or sea salt in fine to coarse grinds. All mechanisms have a lifetime guarantee. Our pepper mechanisms strip the peppercorns to break them into smaller pieces so that flavor is slowly released onto food, rather than crushing the corns and squeezing out the pepperin oils, whereby releasing the flavor very quickly into the atmoshpere. Stainless steel is an ideal material for the pepper mill as it will not corrode and can be made very sharp, giving improved variability of grind. Our standard salt mechanism has a unique anti-static, clog-free design and is molded for high precision with sharp grinding teeth. Nylon is used due to its hard wearing characteristics. Being non-porous, it does not absorb odors and is therefore suitable for salt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-i-F3hRSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cole & Mason","source_asin":"B0017KQC5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0017KQC5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0017KQC5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
