window.products.push({"id":563910,"name":"Exosqueeze Stainless Steel Lemon and Lime Squeezer with Silicone Handles - Manual Juicer Extracts Almost Every Drop of Juice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vbG4PQGvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE & EASY TO USE – This juicer gives extra squeezing power to get more juice. In one single motion, you can squeeze 99% of juice out of the lemon/lime, adding a lot more punch to your margaritas - a must have if you like to squeeze fresh juice for cocktails and will definitely become your new best friend in the kitchen! NO MORE SEEDS – In a matter of moments, you'll be able to extract every drop of juice and without the unwanted pits. Gone are the days of squeezing lemons by hand and worrying about seeds getting mixed in with the juice. This alone is worth it! STRONG & ROBUST – Will not rust, crack or scratch due to its 304-grade stainless steel construction. You can tell by feel that it's quality made - lift this once and you will feel the weight of an item that is built to last and that will not fall apart anytime soon. The product is also dishwasher safe, making it a snap to clean after use. IDEAL SIZE - You will love the size, it's billed as a lemon squeezer, but you can fit a small to medium orange in this baby. The heavy duty construction also means that you are able to put quite a bit of pressure on the larger lemons without fear of the squeezer breaking. COMFORTABLE TO HOLD – Hand and fingers are cushioned during use by the silicone handles. The handles are ergonomic and soft and easy to grip and it doesn't slip when you're trying to squeeze lemons. Its flat handle design also makes it easier to apply a lot of force without hurting your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vbG4PQGvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exosqueeze","source_asin":"B0132KFS74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0132KFS74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0132KFS74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563911,"name":"Waterproof Mattress Protector King | King Mattress Protector | Mattress Cover King Size 76” x 80”| Cooling Mattress Protector | Bamboo Jacquard Bed Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhoSj9S6L._AC_SL1435_.jpg","description":"MOM’S CHOICE AWARDS - Thanks to the superiority of our bamboo waterproof mattress protector, we are honored to be the Gold Winner Of The Prestigious Mom’s Choice Award. PERFECT FIT - Sized at 76” x 80” our cooling waterproof mattress protector fits snugly on the USA standard king mattress. Featuring a fully elasticized skirting and a deep 18” pocket, it helps keep your king size waterproof mattress protector in place PEACE OF MIND - Your mattress is an investment. So give it the best protection with the iLuvBamboo premium king bed waterproof mattress protector! When you experience the comfort, you will notice that our king waterproof mattress protector safeguards your mattress from spills, leaks, sweat and stains. ULTRA COMFORT ASSURED - Feel how soft & silky smooth the surface of our bamboo mattress protector is. Made from the finest breathable bamboo jacquard fabric, you will doze off to dreamland in no time. Wake up feeling fully rested as our breathable mattress protector makes no crinkly sound. EASY CARE – No more worrying about handwashing your king mattress protector waterproof. Simply toss in the wash and dry at low heat for an easy clean. Get two or more. When one is in the wash, replace with a fresh mattress cover for an all-time protection. DURABILITY YOU CAN COUNT ON - Our long-lasting king mattress protector cooling cover is made from premium bamboo jacquard material that does not snag easily unlike the bamboo terry material out in the market. No more wasting money on cover that does not last. PROTECTION FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY - Great for nursing moms, sick kids, elderly, potty training or pets on the bed. When accidents occur, our waterproof king size mattress protector will make your life a little easier. It is free from pvc, phthalate and vinyl too. MULTIPLE SIZES TO CHOOSE FROM - Available in Twin, Twin XL, Full, Full XL, Queen, King, and California King sizes. Make your selection be it for hospital beds, dormitory, RV or truck bunk. ESSENTIAL GIFT IDEAS – Give the gift of essentials which your loved ones, family and friends will appreciate. The iLuvBamboo king cooling mattress protector is great for Christmas, Birthdays, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day or any other special occasion OUR PROMISE TO YOU - We pride ourselves in providing superior quality products for families to lead an easier and more comfortable lifestyle. As we only give our family the best, we know that yours deserve the best too. If for whatever reason you’re not completely satisfied with the mattress protector king size waterproof, we’ll make it right or your refund back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhoSj9S6L._AC_SL1435_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I LUV BAMBOO","source_asin":"B0BRQ3QRGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQ3QRGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQ3QRGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":563912,"name":"Makion 300 LED Christmas Star String Fairy Lights with Star Topper, 8 Modes Waterfall Fairy Lights Lights, Indoor Outdoor LED Twinkle Light for Christ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k5EQU59AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【300 LED Star String Lights 】: This star string lights have a total of 1 plastic top star, 300 led lights, 9 light strings and 10 ground nails. Star String lights can be installed flexibly, use your imagination and creativity, DIY into the style you want to create the perfect atmosphere for the party. Use this Christmas star string lights to decorate your Christmas! 【Easy to Install & Safe】: The twinkle lights installation steps are simple. Hang the string lights on a tree or wall, then unfold each string of lights and secure it with nails. The waterfall lights are simple to use, plug it in and unplug it directly to turn the light on and off. 29v low voltage makes the star lights safer to use. 【Easy Storage & Memory Function】：Each string of lights comes with a small storage rope, very convenient when using and packing, no need to worry about the string lights will be messed up. Star string lights have a memory function, will save your last starlight mode settings, no need to reset every time you use the twinkle lights. 【8 lighting modes】：The fairy lights have 8 lighting modes: combination, chasing/flash, sequential, in waves ,slow fade, twinkle/flash, slo-glo and steady on. Simply press the white round button on the power plug to set the lighting mode. A variety of lighting modes can be well suited for indoor and outdoor decorating needs. 【Perfect Christmas Gift】：Star string lights are suitable for tree decoration, garden decoration, roof decoration, outdoor lighting, etc. Also the best choice for Christmas decoration, can be used as indoor Christmas decorations, outdoor Christmas decorations, Christmas tree decorations, etc. It is a great Christmas gift for family, lovers and friends. Let the twinkle lights accompany you to spend a warm Christmas!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k5EQU59AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Makion","source_asin":"B081DZKMXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081DZKMXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081DZKMXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
