window.products.push({"id":563933,"name":"SöMN Kömforte Microfiber Dual Zone Comforter, His and Hers Blankets for Couples, Cool & Warm Two Temperature Comforter, Alternative Down Duvet Insert,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGvWfofcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber DUAL ZONE DESIGN - HOT OR COLD, IT’S JUST RIGHT: Say goodbye to compromise and hello to individualized comfort. The Kömforte features dual zones, providing cozy warmth for one person and cooling bliss for the other. This way, both parties can enjoy a restful night's sleep without sacrifice. OPTIMAL TEMPERATURE CONTROL: Experience personalized comfort like never before with Kömforte's innovative dual temperature duvet. Featuring 300gsm fill on one side for cozy warmth and 150gsm on the other for refreshing coolness, simply use the easy tie Duvet Tabs to effortlessly switch between the two. Stay comfortable all night long with the comforter that was designed for couples. HYPOALLERGENIC AND LUXURIOUSLY SOFT: Made from microfiber down alternative, the Kömforte is not only luxurious and soft to the touch but also hypoallergenic. This means that you can drift off to dreamland without worrying about pesky allergies, allowing you to wake up feeling revitalized and energized. GIFT GOOD SLEEP: The Kömforte makes the perfect gift for your loved ones. Give the gift of good sleep and refreshing rest to your friends and family, and watch as they wake up feeling rejuvenated and ready to tackle the day. A must have gift for newlyweds. SWEDISH-INSPIRED DESIGN FOR A STYLISH BEDROOM: The Kömforte's contemporary, simple, and clean aesthetic is designed with Swedish style and comfort in mind. Choose from bold touches of navy or stick with subtle tones like white, beige or gray, this dual temp comforter integrates seamlessly into any bedroom decor. We stand behind the quality of our product. We guarantee 100% happiness and sweet dreams, or your money back. Try the Kömforte today and get ready to enjoy your best night's sleep yet!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGvWfofcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SöMN","source_asin":"B07MVNBM6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-563933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MVNBM6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MVNBM6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
